Exact text changes for the main context's match-based edits — two replacements:

1. The whole function, previously
```rust
/// Policy-wide modifiers apply to the policy base premium, the sum of all
/// item base premiums. Every quoted item is treated as a first insurance.
fn apply_policy_modifiers(_customer: &Customer, policy_base: f64) -> f64 {
    policy_base + policy_base * FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE
}
```
now
```rust
/// The policy-wide modifier rate, charged against the policy base premium --
/// the sum of all item base premiums. The MHPCO reads one such modifier today:
/// a first insurance carries an initial assessment surcharge.
fn policy_modifier_rate(_customer: &Customer) -> f64 {
    FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE
}
```

